    "name": "Balaur v0.1.0",
    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Dragos/impl polyglot pirates needed features by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/2\r\n* Improve node performance by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/4\r\n* Primitives, paths, booleans and cloners by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/5\r\n* objects: the example photographs itself, and a bad mesh path is heard headless by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/6\r\n* ci: tell the website when a nightly is published by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/7\r\n* Update editor to use nodes and not imediate mode by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/8\r\n* add tilemap editor by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/9\r\n* use smolstr to improve node find perf. by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/10\r\n* Editor updates / qol improvements by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/11\r\n* Updates to release process by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/12\r\n* on web there is a differetn backend for files by @Ughuuu in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/13\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Ughuuu made their first contribution in https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/pull/2\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/balaurengine/balaur/commits/v0.1.0",
